      "content": "idk i just feel like he's acting normal otherwise he's just a bit tired and playing with his cars. i really dont want to deal with the er at 2am if it's just a common bug. can i just give him some tylenol and wait until the morning to see if the spots fade? like maybe it's just skin irritation?",
